<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Your Mashar Alumni Application Has Been Received</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #F0F2F5;
            color: #1A1A2E;
            padding: 40px 16px;
        }

        .email-wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #E1E5ED; border-radius: 10px; }

        /* Orange top accent bar */
        .top-accent {
            height: 5px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #F5A623 0%, #F7B733 100%);
            border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
        }

        /* Navy header */
        .email-header {
            background-color: #1A237E;
            padding: 36px 40px 32px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.25em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #F5A623;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .header-title {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            line-height: 1.3;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header-subtitle {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #B0B8E8;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* White body */
        .email-body {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            padding: 40px 40px 36px;
        }

        /* Success notice — matches website green notice box */
        .success-notice {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
            background-color: #F0FBF4;
            border: 1.5px solid #A8E6BF;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .notice-icon {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            background-color: #2ECC71;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 1px;
        }

        .notice-icon svg {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
        }

        .notice-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #1A6B3A;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* Greeting */
        .greeting {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .greeting strong {
            color: #1A237E;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .body-text {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.75;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* Steps card */
        .steps-card {
            background-color: #F7F8FC;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px 28px;
            margin: 28px 0;
            border: 1px solid #E8EBFF;
        }

        .steps-title {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1A237E;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .step-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 14px;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #E8EBFF;
        }

        .step-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
            padding-bottom: 0;
        }

        .step-item:first-child {
            padding-top: 0;
        }

        .step-num {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            width: 26px;
            height: 26px;
            background-color: #1A237E;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 1px;
        }

        .step-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #444;
            line-height: 1.65;
        }

        .step-text strong {
            color: #1A237E;
        }

        /* CTA Button — matches website's navy button */
        .cta-wrap {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 32px 0 28px;
        }

        .cta-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #1A237E;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 15px 48px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        /* Closing */
        .closing-text {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.75;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        /* Signature */
        .signature {
            padding-top: 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid #EAECF5;
        }

        .sig-warm {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #888;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .sig-name {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1A237E;
        }

        .sig-role {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #AAA;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-top: 3px;
        }

        .sig-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 6px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #F5A623;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .email-footer {
            background-color: #1A237E;
            border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
            padding: 24px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer-links {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: #8B97D8;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 10px;
        }

        .footer-note {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #B0B8E8;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .footer-note a {
            color: #F5A623;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {

            .email-header,
            .email-body {
                padding: 28px 24px;
            }

            .header-title {
                font-size: 20px;
            }

            .email-footer {
                padding: 20px 24px;
            }

            .steps-card {
                padding: 18px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">

        <!-- Orange accent top bar -->
        <div class="top-accent"></div>

        <!-- Navy Header -->
        <div class="email-header">
            <div class="brand-logo">Mashar Alumni Network</div>
            <h1 class="header-title">Your Application Has Been Received</h1>
            <p class="header-subtitle">We've successfully received your alumni application here's what to expect next.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div class="email-body">

            <p class="greeting">Dear <strong><%= full_name.split(' ')[0] %></strong>,</p>

            <p class="body-text">
                Thank you for applying to join the <strong style="color:#1A237E;">Mashar Alumni Network</strong>. We have successfully received your application.
            </p>

            <p class="body-text">
                Our team will review your eligibility, and you can expect a decision within <strong>5–7 business days</strong>. Once approved, you will receive a confirmation email with your dashboard access and next steps.
            </p>

            <div class="cta-wrap">
                <a href="https://mashar.org/" class="cta-btn" style="color: #FFFFFF;">Visit Mashar.org</a>
            </div>

            <div class="signature">
                <p class="sig-warm">Warm regards,</p>
                <div class="sig-name">Mashar Alumni Team</div>
                <div class="sig-role">Alumni Relations &amp; Community</div>
                <a href="https://mashar.org/" class="sig-link">mashar.org</a>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="email-footer">
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="https://mashar.org/">Website</a>
                <a href="#">Privacy Policy</a>
                <a href="#">Contact Us</a>
                <a href="#">Unsubscribe</a>
            </div>
            <p class="footer-note">
                You're receiving this because you applied to the Mashar Alumni Network.<br>
                © 2025 Mashar. All rights reserved. · <a href="https://mashar.org/">mashar.org</a>
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>

</html>